# Packages in packages.list that are NOT in the official Arch repos.
#
# Why this file exists: `hyprpolkit-agent` was in packages.list for a long time
# and nothing ever flagged it, because the real package is `hyprpolkitagent` -
# no hyphen. A misspelled name and a removed name are indistinguishable from the
# outside: both make `pacman -Si` and `yay -Si` fail, and the only thing
# validation can report is "nothing answered".
#
# So the AUR-only set is declared here. `tests/review-checks.sh` fails if a
# package is neither in the official repos nor listed here, which turns a typo
# into a CI failure instead of a silent "Package not found".
#
# Add a package here when you add it to packages.list and it is AUR-only.
# Remove it here if it is ever moved into the official repos.

wlogout
waypaper
wallust
visual-studio-code-bin
supergfxctl
brave-bin
